WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:03.810
All right! We swept the Autumn Idol Grand Prix!

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.640
And that means tomorrow's the celebration concert!

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.460
That's the power of the unstoppable Dorothy!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.810
And for that celebration concert...

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:12.770
Yeah!

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.110
You can count me out.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.450
What?

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.630
But why?

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.670
It's to celebrate our victory!

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:58.930
You remember Mister Genius and his promise...

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:01.390
to take our Autumn Dream Parade Coords at the celebration concert?

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:04.890
<i>I will attain your Autumn Coords when next we meet.</i>

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.380
He's not satisfied with the Summer Coords; he wants the Autumn ones too!

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.480
Stuff that.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.760
Well, okay...

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:16.330
But if he <i>does</i> show up, we can just take the Summer Coords back!

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:20.030
Yeah, but last time time he blew right past our defences.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:23.300
Are the PriPara police really up to the task?

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.730
Of course they are!

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:25.950
Right, Ajimi-sensei?

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:27.910
I'd say naught-Da Vinci.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.370
You heard her. I'm out.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:33.090
Aw, come on...

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:35.380
The concert's that big a deal to you?

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.680
You're <i>that</i> anxious to show off...

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:40.660
in front of Reona and the others who didn't win?

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:41.680
Really?

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.960
Mirei, Sophie and Aroma haven't won at all, you know?

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:52.900
See?

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:56.350
Mikan, you don't want to bum Aroma out either, right?

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:58.010
I like singing.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.860
But not if it makes Aroma sad.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.970
It's kind of a cosmic shame...

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:07.540
We may have to give it a miss this time.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.040
Capisce...

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:16.110
We didn't win the Grand Prix this time either...

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:21.030
True, even though Lala and Dorothy have won two apiece...

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:22.510
We haven't even won one.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:23.220
But...

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.970
I'm sure we will next time!

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:32.900
Enter.

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:34.500
Excuse me.

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.860
I'm here to deliver the student council logbook.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:38.830
Very good.

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:46.730
Acting deputy...

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:50.530
Do you find yourself captivated by your reflection?

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.690
Every day.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:53.750
What of it?

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.080
Oh, I just...

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:59.500
was thinking of how the
Phantom Thief Genius was a narcissist.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.720
Good day, acting deputy.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.100
I wasn't expecting...

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:08.380
That a team containing Houjou Sophie and Toudou Shion both,

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:12.940
those two eminent genii, could possibly <i>lose</i> a Grand Prix.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:16.230
Just who held them back, I wonder?

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:21.150
"Those without talent can close the gap with effort"?

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:22.900
How callow.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:25.870
They should stand back and allow genii to flourish.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.120
I... have lessons to attend to.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:41.670
One, two, three, four!

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.130
Five, six, seven, eight!

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:44.700
It's pri unusual to see you training alone.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:47.240
One, two, three, four!

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:47.720
Five, six, seven...

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.350
The loss took the pri out of your sails?

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:49.360
Five, six, seven...

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:52.250
My spirits are as high and unhallowed as ever.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:59.020
But the sin of being unable to lead the peons to victory falls upon me!

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:01.480
Since when were <i>you</i> the pri-eader?

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:05.100
Regardless, we need but amass
magical power and pool our efforts...

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:08.120
and the path the hell shall be illuminated.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:10.420
Hearing the devil talk about effort-pri...

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:12.580
D–Did I here some blasphemy pass those lips?

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:16.790
Besides, you're always blathering about how necessary lessons are!

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.920
We're in step for once, it seems-pri.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.380
Wanna practice together?

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.880
As long as you don't trip me up.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.380
That's my line-pri.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.010
Go for it, you two-kuma!

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:28.570
One, two, three, four!

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:31.580
<i>Just who held them back, I wonder?</i>

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:32.010
One, two, three, four!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.600
I'm home!

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.190
Onee-chan!

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:43.510
Our whole class is going to watch the celebration concert!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:46.240
You'd better make sure you don't make me look bad!

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:48.660
It's been called off.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:50.120
Huh?

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:55.190
The Phantom Thief's just gonna come and take our coords anyway. What's the point?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.080
Onee-chan...

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:00.120
Onee-chan, you're so...

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.040
Spineless!

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:07.220
Me and all my friends...

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:11.010
we don't have a PriTicket yet; we can't even <i>go</i> to PriPara!

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:14.520
So we look forward to watching on TV and cheering for you!

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:20.260
I thought you were so cool,
being in such an amazing competition!

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:23.320
I was thinking about maybe even...

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.960
even <i>congratulating</i> you...

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:26.110
Non...

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:30.660
How could you <i>give up</i> just because of some stupid phantom thief?

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.880
Onee-chan, you dumb, spineless jerk – I hate you!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:34.500
Non!

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:38.900
Lala-chan!

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:40.120
Eiko-chan?

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:43.540
We'll be cheering you on at tomorrow's celebration concert!

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:45.960
See you then!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.060
You want to do it again now?

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:03.810
There are girls who don't have PriTickets...

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:07.210
and others who want to cheer us on!
They're looking forward it!

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:11.490
How can idol not perform because they're afraid of some phantom thief?

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:14.170
Yeah, and when he steals our coords, what then?

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:18.100
And you agreed it'd be hard doing it in front of Mirei and the others, too.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:19.890
W–Well, yeah...

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.770
Mirei? That outfit's your...

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:25.610
idol prosecutor coord?

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:27.340
You're still at school?

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.880
We're all ready over here.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:29.930
Huh?

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:31.070
Please allow me to check your belongings-panda.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:33.180
I hope they can arrest him.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.930
Mm, but he's totally my type...

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.330
Go, phantom thief!

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:41.810
You're clean-glo. Next!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:44.960
The security they've set up is out of the cosmos.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.920
Is this all for the celebration concert?

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:49.070
You bet it is.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:53.990
Mirei, Shion!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:57.120
We'll be assisting with the security as well.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.700
The phantom thief won't escape the long arm of the law.

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:01.660
I shall whet my blade upon him!

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.630
Not that you can sharpen a wooden shinai.

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:07.170
You can perform without fear.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:12.880
The policeman's soul inside me is getting Munch, Edvar-ed up!

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:16.510
It's been piqued and my excitement's at a peak-asso!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.140
Da Vinci.

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.180
Ponkan's gonna catch the phantom thief!

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:23.350
So I have to make my super secret preparations –

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.600
I've gotta run-oire!

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:31.480
No one thought we'd call it off at all.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.020
We've gotta do our best too!

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:36.030
Yep, yep!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.600
All right, I get it.

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:40.120
For cryin' out loud...

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:43.250
There's no point if I don't sing anyway, is there?

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:46.730
Our opponent appears and disappears like smoke.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.690
We can't assume we have him barred like this.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:52.680
Phantom Thief Genius – come at me any time!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.700
You don't have to <i>try</i> to pick a fight.

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:55.580
<i>Go</i>?

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.240
I've never heard such restrained words from you.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.710
Per... Perhaps...

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:01.680
Don't worry about a thing!

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:05.140
The PriPara Nurses are here as well!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.400
PriPara Nurses?

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:12.360
We should have nurses on standby in case anyone gets hurt.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:15.360
I can take care of anything to do with medicinal plants.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.320
Yodel-le-ea-fu!

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:19.530
This herb treats constipation and fever.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:23.250
I usually apply a jellyfish, though...

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.370
Doesn't it sting you?

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:27.330
I'm wouldn't trust them to treat any injuries.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.080
True...

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.200
And all the while...

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.780
Where am I? Who am I?

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:39.510
I can't think of a plan to catch the phantom thief at all-Da Vinci...

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.470
And the concert's about to start!

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:55.500
Da-Da-Da Vinci! Da-Da-Da Vinci!

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.450
I've figured out how to Turner...

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.830
the tables on the Phantom Thief, G-Mark my words!

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.700
Da Vinci!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:18.390
Thank you for waiting, everyone.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:21.260
The winning team of the Autumn Dream Idol Grand Prix,

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:25.040
Cosmic Omurice Da Vinci, will now perform their celebration concert!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.810
The word "love" is written with ketchup on the omelet rice.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.730
And the coord expresses the same love!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:35.720
Omurice Ketchup Coord!

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:37.440
Da Vinci!

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:41.220
And "smile" is written on the mayonnaise-and-roe sauce.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:43.860
Doesn't it just bring a smile to your face?

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:46.160
Omurice Mayo Roe Coord!

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:48.560
Geru!

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:53.500
Herbs are fried in butter within the frypan.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.050
Nothing in the universe compares to this cooking show!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.650
Delicious Chef Coord!

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:59.220
Cosmo!

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.260
Yay!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.850
Blink and you'll miss it!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.230
Da Vinci, everyone!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.780
Cosmic Omurice Da Vinci is invincible!

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:24.190
Dream Theatre Concert, switch on!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:37.060
Airy Change!

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:44.030
Cyalume Airy!

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:46.460
Cyalume Airy!

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:54.460
Thank you all!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.500
We're cosmically grateful!

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.540
Tension max!

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.800
Isn't it fun?

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:14.230
Ring the bell of everyone's dreams!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.270
Everyone's dreams become one!

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:24.760
Resound, Charm Bell!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.280
Thankies!

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.950
Thank you!

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:39.460
It's over already?

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:40.920
That's not what they usually do...

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.130
And the Phantom Thief never showed...

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:43.380
I wanted to see him..

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:44.840
Is it over now?

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:50.340
Everyone! I want to say-nt Peter's Basilica: thank-ubrick! Thank-ubism!

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:53.060
Thank you, everyone!

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.480
We love you!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:56.010
Thank you cosmically!

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:57.900
We switcheded our clothes!

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:59.020
I see!

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.110
That was their plan!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.760
No phantom thief's getting his hands on these!

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.940
This plan is Ponkan's pièce de Renaissance!

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:10.410
Nothing's happening?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.960
Well done, everyone.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.870
A truly splendid performance.

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:15.220
Meganii!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:16.580
Thank you!

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:19.580
And the coords are safe and sound, too.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.840
Let's get them to a secure place right away.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:23.300
I'll take care of them.

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.010
Sure thing-Da Vinci!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.680
Well done, everyone.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:28.470
A truly splendid performance.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:30.070
Meganii?

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:31.380
Thank you!

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:38.050
There are two Meganiis?

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:39.560
They look the same-same!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:40.960
He's multiplying!

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:41.940
Cosmic!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.150
How shock-limt-Da Vinci!

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:45.450
So he's...

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:47.860
shown himself at last!

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:51.390
I am the real Meganii. That one is a fake.

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:54.950
No, I am the real Meganii. That one is the fake.

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:56.830
You certainly are persistent.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.580
Stylish!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.580
Tough!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.790
Guy!

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:03.670
How's that?

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.170
You won't defeat me.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.920
Stylish!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:07.920
Tough!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.130
Guy!

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:12.420
Not bad at all.

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:14.250
I must compliment you as well.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:15.600
Will you take this seriously?

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:18.130
I cosmically can't tell them apart.

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:19.940
Does that mean they're both real?

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.500
Um, so...

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.410
That one, I knows it!
It's cosmically him.
That one-Da Vinci.
It's gotta be that one!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:25.020
Okay, this one!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.240
No, he's–

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:27.860
When the wings which soar...

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.050
in the sky are spread...

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:40.120
A sole lilium casa blanca shall bloom in the darkness!

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:44.790
My name is Phantom Thief Genius!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.710
Phantom Thief Genius!

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:52.680
I believe I sent an advance notice:
I will take the coords at the celebration concert.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.890
Indeed, and so we waited for you!

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.930
We won't let you get away!

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:03.040
And you think you can do that by aping my methods?

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.060
Let us find out!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.570
Go get him, Meganii-san!

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.660
Go for it, Meganii!

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:11.030
Don't let him beat you, Phantom!

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:15.410
Oh no!

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:20.950
Do take care, my dear.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.210
To commemorate our meeting.

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:24.920
Oh, Lord Genius!

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:29.880
To you foolish idols, endlessly repeating your pretense of <i>friendship</i>...

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:31.880
Farewell!

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:39.700
He's gone.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:40.820
No way...

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:42.560
He stole them <i>again</i>?

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:44.610
It's okay-Da Vinci!

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.270
The real Autumn Coords...

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:49.640
didn't art nouveau anywhere-Da Vinci!

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:50.950
What? How?

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:56.490
Before the show began, Meganii, Ham-senpai and I...

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.410
prepared some fakes ahead of time!

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:02.120
So the coords the phantom stole...

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:04.180
Were the fakes-Da Vinci!

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:05.380
All right!

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:07.360
Way to go, Ajimi-sensei!

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.130
I knew we could leave it to the PriPara Police!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.350
Not bad!

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:10.800
Not at all!

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:14.300
Say, I can't seem to find Rina-chan anywhere.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.680
Phantom Thief Genius?

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:24.270
Your schemes have proven an amusing diversion.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.000
Thank you for your cooperation, milady.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.530
Rina-chan!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:35.550
I have attained the true Autumn Coords.

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:36.860
Now the curtain falls!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:37.620
He got us!

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:38.320
After him!

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.700
That jerk!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:40.910
Get back here!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.330
You won't outrun me!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.290
Ponkan's going Renoir-fter him too!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.710
Please stay calm, everyone.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.250
Hologrammation!

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:55.440
We're tracking his movements.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.520
The power's not restored yet-panda?

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:01.510
How strange-panda!

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:03.180
I'm looking into it-panda!

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:10.730
Well done-panda.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.540
Hey, he's not here-panda.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.320
But we should have trapped him here-panda.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.680
Very strange-panda.

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:20.620
A tracking device.

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:24.040
He's stopped.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:25.820
He's on 4-F.

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:26.750
Let's go!

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.280
No, wait.

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:30.210
That's not...

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:31.270
I'm starved-panda.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:33.170
Where'd that phantom thief get to-panda?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.650
It's in front of the bamboo grass vending machine.

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:40.100
He seems to have picked up on our trick.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:43.460
So if he's trying to lead us above...

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:44.260
He's below!

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.310
Everyone, head to the basement!

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.610
Phantom Thief Genius!

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.780
Why are you doing these mean things?

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:03.410
I will bring revolution to PriPara.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:05.010
What revolution?

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.270
There's no use telling you.

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:07.430
Tell me what it is!

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:08.740
A type of sugar cube.

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:09.620
You're lying!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:10.910
Yes, I am.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.540
I won't let you get away with this!

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:16.050
We're gonna catch you and take our coords back!

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:19.680
I welcome you to try – if you <i>can</i>.

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:21.710
You're not getting away!

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:22.440
Lala!

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:23.120
The phantom?

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:23.390
Yeah!

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:25.350
This way's a shortcut!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:29.740
The power's...

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:30.520
back on.

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:37.570
He read our moves!

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:51.120
What?

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:56.280
But he should have taken this one!

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:57.800
He's disappeared again...

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:01.470
Meganii-san!

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:05.720
If our coords keep getting stolen, then the Parade...

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.230
Don't worry.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:10.180
It will be held as scheduled.

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:16.150
Let's see if the system will reprint the stolen coords.

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:19.070
We won't let the phantom do as he pleases.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.860
We will capture him without fail!

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:25.950
Onee-chan!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:26.880
Non!

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.470
We saw your show!

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:31.150
The coords were stolen, but you really gave it your all!

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.400
Congratulations!

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:35.500
Make sure you catch the phantom sometime, too!

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:38.090
Thanks and capisce!

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:41.580
I'm not...

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:43.860
gonna give up!

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:18.020
Long time no scare, everyone!

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:19.710
Ah! It's a ghost!

00:22:19.710 --> 00:22:22.160
I'm not a ghost! I'm Ran-tan!

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:24.160
Take a clo-scare look!

00:22:24.160 --> 00:22:26.380
Ca–Capisce!

00:22:26.380 --> 00:22:29.910
Next time, <i>Have a Good Fright and a Happy Halloween!</i>.
